          "fill": "#252A2E",
          "content": "请在预约前阅读以下重要内容",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "bold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "L5PlV",
          "x": 29,
          "y": 227,
          "name": "条款标题0",
          "fill": "#252A2E",
          "content": "一、服务范围",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "bold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "FrsUT",
          "x": 29,
          "y": 252,
          "name": "条款内容0",
          "fill": "#626A6C",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 297,
          "content": "门店提供约定期间的住宿、日常喂食、清洁及动态记录。特殊护理以订单确认内容为准。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "Lvgxn",
          "x": 29,
          "y": 333,
          "name": "条款标题1",
          "fill": "#252A2E",
          "content": "二、健康告知",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "bold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "W9LeX",
          "x": 29,
          "y": 358,
          "name": "条款内容1",
          "fill": "#626A6C",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 297,
          "content": "宠主须如实填写疫苗、驱虫、过敏及用药资料。入店时门店将核验健康状态。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "XBFS9",
          "x": 29,
          "y": 439,
          "name": "条款标题2",
          "fill": "#252A2E",
          "content": "三、入住与离店",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "bold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "R1EKYB",
          "x": 29,
          "y": 464,
          "name": "条款内容2",
          "fill": "#626A6C",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 297,
          "content": "请在预约日期内完成交接，并携带宠物及必要物品。超时离店费用按实际天数结算。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 11,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "C22za",
          "x": 29,
          "y": 545,
          "name": "条款标题3",
          "fill": "#252A2E",
          "content": "四、取消与退款",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
          "fontSize": 13,
          "fontWeight": "bold"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "mLaD6",
          "x": 29,
          "y": 570,
          "name": "条款内容3",
          "fill": "#626A6C",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 297,
          "content": "取消和退款以订单展示的规则为准；已发生的服务费用及第三方支付费用按协议处理。",
          "fontFamily": "Noto Sans SC",
